  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc4:2.1.7": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Padaso</i> does not literally mean “memorize”, but something like “by the line”. The reason I have “memorize” here is simply an artifact of  my translation of the rule just above. The expression <i lang='pi' translate='no'>padaso dhammaṁ vāceyya</i> literally means “causing (someone) to say the Teaching by the line”, which implies helping another to memorize the teaching, hence my rendering. ",
